During the second meeting with the customer, some additional features were requested for the Portfolio_Manager.
1. Change Currency from Dollar to INR
Currently, portfolio values are displayed in Dollars ($).
The customer wants all values to be displayed in Indian Rupees (₹ INR).
2.Import Holdings Using CSV File
Users should be able to add multiple holdings at once by uploading a CSV file.
This will save time compared to adding each holding manually.
3.Export Holdings Statement as PDF
Users should be able to download their holdings details as a PDF report.
4.Export Portfolio Summary as PDF
Users should be able to export a complete summary of their portfolio.
